<title>NORWAY: FORECAST-Statistics Norway sees 96 GDP at 4.3 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Statistics Norway sees 96 GDP at 4.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway on Thursday revised forecasts for economic indicators in a quarterly report as follows.</p>
<p>			   (growth rates in pct unless stated):</p>
<p>				   September forecast   June forecast</p>
<p>					 1996    1997	1996  1997</p>
<p> GDP				    4.3     2.3	 4.3   2.2</p>
<p> GDP mainland			 3.0     2.4	 3.0   2.3</p>
<p> CPI				    1.4     2.2	 1.4   2.0</p>
</text>
